[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_3A_IC]
Internal Combustion Engine

[l_english.MODULE_ENGINE_3A_IC_desc]
The invention of the internal combustion engine was revolutionary in Equestria, as it was the first time that the Equestrian military realized that they could run out of fuel.

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_3A_IC]
内燃机

[l_simp_chinese.MODULE_ENGINE_3A_IC_desc]
内燃机的发明在小马利亚世界是划时代的，得益于内燃机，小马利亚世界的军队首次认识到“燃料不足”这一概念。
